{
  "name": "GoalIsOfTypeGoal",
  "comment": "item-doors 62/63: a goal's type is the plain goal type, not the app's node. %!app.goal.type.name% is goal, and a goal's\n%g!type% written is the goal type's face (goal). Red before: Replace swapped the type list's own goal entry for the app's\nnode, so asking a goal what type it is answered the node (the dump of every goal), not goal.",
